  "description": "📚 Find Your $1M Business Idea (10x Faster) with Case Studies - https://www.starterstory.com/?utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=smartnonsense&yts=true\n\n📩 Business Ideas Newsletter - https://www.starterstory.com/newsletter\n\nIn this video, I'm in Chicago to meet Dylan and Henry - two college roommates who built a $2M/Year business to fund their creative dreams. They share their strategies for landing BIG clients (Ali Abdaal, Will Smith, Naval...), AND the secret that has gotten them over 1 billion views on YouTube. But the best part about their business - they optimize for fun first... THEN for money.\n\n0:00 - Intro\n1:04 - Meet The Boys\n1:26 - Business Breakdown\n2:04 - Content Strategy\n2:28 - 1 Billion Views\n2:43 - Background\n3:43 - Finding The Idea (Blitz Strategy)\n4:56 - How They Self-Funded The Business\n5:38 - Landing Big Clients (Squatter Marketing)\n7:08 - How To Create Viral Content\n8:09 - How To Hire\n8:45 - Where To Find Talented Editors\n9:22 - Costs of The Team\n9:56 - Starting A Business With A Friend\n10:58 - Content OVER Money\n11:30 - Day in the life\n12:05 - Future Vision & Strategy\n12:59 - How To Find Profitable Ideas\n13:30 - Advice\n\nFollow The Boys\n🐦 Twitter - https://twitter.com/DylanJardon\n🐦 Twitter - https://twitter.com/HenryBelcaster\n🎥 YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/@dylanjardon\n🎥 YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/@HenryBelcaster\n\nOur Links\n🔔 Subscribe - https://www.youtube.com/@starterstory\n📸 Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/starter_story/\n🐦 Twitter - https://twitter.com/thepatwalls",
